Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 11:54:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(session): own work on the left, sides named per
 operation

Orientation from Repo::stop() decides once per stop which git side
each pane shows; disk and index stay in git's order (Markers.first).
SideName gains Revert and Patch.

Refs plan #86 #87
